{"quest":{"line_id":"14010538","line_type":"5","order":552,"title":{"cn":"地底观光指南","en":"Underground Tour","jp":"地下観光ガイド","kr":"지하 관광 가이드"},"description":{"cn":"矮人雷克正在开发萨洛克兰的地底观光路线，你们解决了观光项目开发的阻碍。","en":"Dwarf Ruack is developing an underground tour route beneath Sal'thorin. You help clear the obstacles.","jp":"ドワーフのレックは、サロクディアの地下観光ルートを開拓していた。あなたたちは、開拓の障壁を取り除いた。","kr":"드워프 레이크가 셀로클랜드 지하 관광 노선을 개발 중이다. 레이크의 사업을 방해하는 것들을 치워주었다."},"reputation_camp_id":"402","reputation_camp_title":{"cn":"萨罗克兰","en":"Sal'thorin","jp":"サロクディア","kr":"셀로클랜드"},"route":"#/season-4/daily/14010538","assets":[{"asset_key":"optional/objective_14010538:1:1"},{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234650"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_14010538:1:2"},{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234660"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_14010538:1:3"},{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234670"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_14010538:1:4"},{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234710"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_14010538:1:5"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_14010538:1:6"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_14010538:1:7"},{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234720"}],"tasks":[{"task_id":"1","steps":[{"step_id":"1","pre_step_ids":[],"objective_title":{"cn":"与沙利叶对话","en":"Talk to Ravion","jp":"サリエと話す","kr":"사리에와 대화하기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"与沙利叶对话，看看他是否需要帮助。","en":"Talk to Ravion and see if he needs any help.","jp":"サリエと話し、力になれることがあるか尋ねよう。","kr":"사리에와 대화해 도움이 필요한지 물어보자."}},{"step_id":"2","pre_step_ids":["1"],"objective_title":{"cn":"找到矮人雷克","en":"Find Ruack","jp":"レックを探す","kr":"드워프 레이크 찾기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"前往奥术巨梯附近，找到矮人雷克。","en":"Go to the Arcane Lift and look for Ruack.","jp":"魔術の昇降機のところに行って、ドワーフのレックを見つけよう。","kr":"아케인 승강기 근처에서 드워프 레이크를 찾자."}},{"step_id":"3","pre_step_ids":["2"],"objective_title":{"cn":"与矮人雷克对话","en":"Talk to Ruack","jp":"レックと話す","kr":"드워프 레이크와 대화하기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"与矮人雷克对话，询问他遇到了什么麻烦。","en":"Talk to the dwarf Ruack and ask what trouble he's run into.","jp":"レックと話し、何が